Manifest-Version: 1.0
Bundle-Description: This repository contains a lightweight implementat
 ion of the Command Query Responsibility Segregation (CQRS) pattern wr
 itten in 100% Java. It provides abstractions for Commands, Queries, a
 nd their respective handlers, enabling clear separation between write
  and read operations. The library supports extensible pipelines for v
 alidation, logging, and idempotency, and is designed to integrate sea
 mlessly with event-driven architectures and microservices. Core compo
 nents include command dispatching, query handling, and customizable e
 xecution flows, allowing developers to build scalable and maintainabl
 e systems with minimal boilerplate.
